Use Arg request, response
response~content_type = "text/plain"
-- Probe for the chunked POST body reading (design-post-body-reading.md).
-- Reports the transfer_encoding discriminator and the args parsed from the
-- body, so a test can prove the body was read to EOF (no CONTENT_LENGTH) and
-- reassembled in order.
Say "transfer_encoding="request~transfer_encoding
n = request~arg()
Say "count="n
Do i = 1 To n
  Say i": "request~arg(i,"Name")"="request~arg(i,"Value")
End
